A FUCKING PROJECT GOALS

What was bad in legacy version:

 - Bloated sprite and animations system

 - Predeclared structure of a program (e.g. mainloop system) and
   therefore limited usability of all SDL2 and Ncurses functions

 - Too many files for small image

What we want from new version:

 - Only one structure: image (With ability to plot data from file
   and other images on it and show it on screen)

 - More flexible symbols drawing system (Single-symbol operations on
   a screen, area filling operations, drawing primitives)

 - One-headder file

 - One file per image

 - Embeding in a project only as a QOL tool and not a structure
   defining engine

 - Improved effects system
